      84→## Usage
      85→
      86→```bash
      87→krep [OPTIONS] PATTERN [FILE | DIRECTORY]
      88→krep [OPTIONS] -e PATTERN [FILE | DIRECTORY]
      89→krep [OPTIONS] -f FILE [FILE | DIRECTORY]
      90→krep [OPTIONS] -s PATTERN STRING_TO_SEARCH
      91→krep [OPTIONS] PATTERN < FILE
      92→cat FILE | krep [OPTIONS] PATTERN
      93→echo 'pattern' | krep -f - [FILE | DIRECTORY]
      94→```
